<http://data.silknow.org/event/3e2e56c3-a0bd-3cd1-91f1-45922d6bff6f>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Transferred from the India Museum in 1879. Slip book entry 4058: 'Brocade / Kincob / 1855 / Benares / Small Pine Leafs Crimson Yellow Gold and Silver / These Articles Were Exh'd at Dublin & lent by Secty of State for India to Scotland Which Accounts for  their being out of [illegible] order in the Book.'"@en ;
